      "call_source": "transcript_item",
      "params_digest": "cf6b33ed1a5031b0",
      "query": "{\"content\": \"# Predicted Reasoning: *Juan Baltazar, Warden, et al. v. Eva Daley* (No. 26-146)\\n\\n## Procedural Trajectory and Hold Posture\\n\\nThis petition for a writ of certiorari presents a single statutory question: whether a habeas corpus proceeding brought by a noncitizen detainee under 28 U.S.C. \\u00a7 2241 is a \\\"civil action\\\" eligible for attorney's fee shifting under the Equal Access to Justice Act (EAJA), 28 U.S.C. \\u00a7 2412(d)(1)(A). Below, a divided panel of the Tenth Circuit (157",
